{"name":"Haiti","hex":"#2c2a35","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Haiti","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A country in the Caribbean. Official name: Republic of Haiti.","Synonym of Hispaniola."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Haiti"}],"entries":[{"title":"Haiti","blocks":[{"text":"Haiti, officially the Republic of Haiti, is a country in the Caribbean on the island of Hispaniola in the Caribbean Sea, east of Cuba and Jamaica and south of The Bahamas. It occupies the western side of the island, which it shares with the Dominican Republic. Haiti is the third largest country in the Caribbean by area, and with an estimated population of 11.4 million, it is the most populous Caribbean country. The capital and largest city is Port-au-Prince."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Flag_of_Haiti.svg/330px-Flag_of_Haiti.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haiti","wikidata":"Q790"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Copia_de_Cacicazgos_de_la_Hispaniola.png/500px-Copia_de_Cacicazgos_de_la_Hispaniola.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Copia_de_Cacicazgos_de_la_Hispaniola.png/1280px-Copia_de_Cacicazgos_de_la_Hispaniola.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Copia_de_Cacicazgos_de_la_Hispaniola.png/500px-Copia_de_Cacicazgos_de_la_Hispaniola.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The five caciquedoms of Hispaniola at the time of the arrival of Christopher Columbus","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACopia_de_Cacicazgos_de_la_Hispaniola.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Columbus_landi